MODIFICATIONS BY NETGLADE

This is a modified copy of ably/ably-pubsub-dart, forked at commit
50358867d41d6f72b000872d742eaacc8f1530d7. `lib/` at that commit is
source-identical to the published `ably` 0.2.0 release; the two commits
between the published `v0.2.0` tag and this fork point touch only
README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and pubspec.yaml's repository URLs (a repo
rename), never `lib/`. It is maintained by netglade for the Ably Chat
Flutter SDK. Every change is also offered upstream as a pull request, one
patch per branch; all five have landed on this integration branch
(netglade/chat-v0.2.0). See PATCHES.md for the per-patch branch, commit
and upstream PR status.

